WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.336
Hello Ms. Cale.

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:05.255
I'm happy to 
finally meet you.

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:07.549
You've got this gift.

00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:11.302
Always knowing 
the truth.

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:13.596
I only know if 
something is a lie.

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:16.891
The real trick of it is 
to figure out why.

00:00:20.895 --> 00:00:21.980
There's been a murder

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.815
and I'm trying to figure 
out what happened.

00:00:26.776 --> 00:00:28.528
This death is 
not mysterious.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:29.362
It's tragic.

00:00:31.781 --> 00:00:33.116
Bullshit.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.086
Is that purely 
decorative?

00:00:47.422 --> 00:00:48.798
Not entirely, no.

